将，官至丞相。","tc":"東漢將官，陸紆之子，陸遜之父，出身吳郡陸氏。為人淳厚信實，深受鄉邦宗族愛戴，作為吳郡陸氏成員，官至九江都尉。其子陸遜后為東吳名將，官至丞相。","en":"A military officer of the Later Han, son of Lu Yu and father of Lu Xun, hailing from the Lu clan of Wu Commandery. Honest and trustworthy, he was deeply beloved by his clan and homeland. As a member of the Lu clan of Wu Commandery, he rose to the rank of Commandant of Jiujiang. His son, Lu Xun, later became a renowned general of Eastern Wu and rose to the rank of Prime Minister.","jp":"後漢の武官。陸紆の子、陸遜の父。呉郡陸氏の出身。人柄は純厚誠実で、郷里や一族から深く敬愛された。呉郡陸氏の一族として、官位は九江都尉に至った。子の陸遜は後に東呉の名将となり、丞相にまで上り詰めた。","kr":"동한의 장수로 육우의 아들이자 육손의 아버지이며, 오군 육씨 출신입니다. 성품이 순후하고 신의가 두터워 고향과 종족의 깊은 사랑과 신망을 받았으며, 오군 육씨의 일원으로서 관직은 구강도위에 이르렀습니다. 아들 육손은 훗날 동오의 명장이 되어 승상에 올랐습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1040715","remark":"","surname":"陆","surnameTc":"陸","surnameEn":"Lu","surnameJp":"陸","surnameKr":"육","surnameOther":"","name":"骏","nameTc":"駿","nameEn":"Jun","nameJp":"駿","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"季才","wordTc":"季才","wordEn":"Jicai","wordJp":"季才","wordKr":"계재","wordOther":"","icon":"陆骏","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"64","force":"45","wise":"65","politics":"62","charm":"67","will":"69","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"25/21/20/20/26/65/21/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1001302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"4200","debateSoulPoint":"4200","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/0/1/2/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/0/3/2/2/0/2/0/2/0/1/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"76","loyalty":"99","